<title>UK: Scottish American sets 25 mln stg debenture stock.</title>
<headline>Scottish American sets 25 mln stg debenture stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debenture stock issue was announced by lead manager NatWest Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCOTTISH AMERICAN INVESTMENT CO PLC</p>
<p> AMT    25 MLN STG    COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY	2022</p>
<p> TYPE   DEBENTURE     ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE	***</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS     ONE	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT GILT DUE 2021</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	  ***PAY DATE IS IN ONE WEEK</p>
<p>		SECURED ON A CHARGE OVER THE ASSETS OF THE</p>
<p>		INVESTMENT FUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
